"itter\">https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\nto en"
"able your ir emitter"
msgstr ""
"Mangyaring bisitahin\n<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enab"
"le-ir-emitter\">https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a"
">\nupang paganahin ang iyong ir emitter"

