"ng sa bawat card. Kapaki-pakinabang kapag nag-uulat ng problema."

#: src/main.glade:655 src/onboarding.glade:116
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"

#: src/main.glade:672
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring "
"or KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the "
"TPM when available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only ma"
"ster key. Face auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwal"
"let5 depending on your desktop."
msgstr ""
"I-enable ang face authentication para awtomatikong i-unlock ang iyong "
"login keyring o KWallet sa pag-login. Ligtas nitong iniimbak ang iyong"
" password na selyadong sa TPM kapag available, o naka-encrypt gamit an"
"g AES-256-GCM gamit ang root-only master key. Ang face auth set ay PAM"
"_AUTHTOK para sa pam_gnome_keyring o pam_kwallet5 depende sa iyong des"
"ktop."

